0,The Yogad Culture: Proof of life of Echagueños of - III. SONGS,https://sites.google.com/stud.pnu.edu.ph/theyogadculture/the-tribe/culture/pag-aaliw/iii-songs,"The Yogads generally likes music. Therefore, they have various songs written in their own language. Yogads have folksongs for various occasions such as for marriage, birthing, death, and sickness. These are some of the folksongs of the Yogad Tribe:",Yogad,Austronesian
